# Allbirds — Tree Runner NZ demo
#
# No environment variables are required to render this demo.
# `npm install` → `NO_COLOR=1 FORCE_COLOR=0 npm run render` → `bash add-audio.sh`
# works out of the box. This file exists only as a placeholder for forks that
# add their own integrations (e.g. fal.ai for generated assets).
#
# Optional overrides honored by add-audio.sh:
#   MUSIC_START=8     # seconds into the music track to start (default 8)
#   FADE_IN=1.2       # music fade-in seconds (default 1.2)
